{"id":"ee6e992ddf35c1d4","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-np-and-verifier-notation.md","title":"np and verifier notation","display":"df-np-and-verifier-notation — np and verifier notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-np-and-verifier-notation","display":"df-np-and-verifier-notation — np and verifier notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]","[[73-df-p-notation]]","[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]"],"aliases":["73-df-np-and-verifier-notation","73-definition-10.4"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.1, print pp. 425–434; PDF pp. 447–456; local polynomial-time interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_numbering":"local-catalog; not book numbering","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§13.1–13.3 and §13.7, pp. 320–343, 362–364; local machine/certificate/coding interfaces","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-np-and-verifier-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"df-np-and-verifier-notation — np and verifier notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"995085b8741b47ae\" href=\"?note=995085b8741b47ae\" title=\"73-df-time-complexity-notation\">73-df-time-complexity-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"533df2318af82f63\" href=\"?note=533df2318af82f63\" title=\"73-df-p-notation\">73-df-p-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-np-and-verifier-notation</span><span>73-definition-10.4</span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.1, print pp. 425–434; PDF pp. 447–456; local polynomial-time interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_numbering","html":"local-catalog; not book numbering"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§13.1–13.3 and §13.7, pp. 320–343, 362–364; local machine/certificate/coding interfaces"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\">\\(\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NTIME}\">\\(\\mathrm{NTIME}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm P\">\\(\\mathrm P\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"995085b8741b47ae\" href=\"?note=995085b8741b47ae\" title=\"73-df-time-complexity-notation\">73-df-time-complexity-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"533df2318af82f63\" href=\"?note=533df2318af82f63\" title=\"73-df-p-notation\">73-df-p-notation</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> 使用固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a> 的二进制配对；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\in\\mathrm P\">\\(V\\in\\mathrm P\\)</span> 是语言而非机器，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\">\\(V(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\\)</span> 由下式解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N[n]\">\\(\\mathbb N[n]\\)</span> 为有有限多个自然数系数的多项式函数集合，由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2^m\">\\(\\mathbf2^m\\)</span> 是长度恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的词集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>；配对必须取该文件的固定线性长度配对，不允许更换为任意有效编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\">\\(\\forall n\\)</span> 在多项式定义中明确量化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，所有幂使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^0=1\">\\(0^0=1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NP}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto n^k),\\qquad\n\\mathbb N[n]\\coloneqq\\{p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N:\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(a_0,\\ldots,a_d)\\in\\mathbb N^{d+1}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;p(n)=\\sum_{i=0}^d a_in^i\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NP}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto n^k),\\qquad\n\\mathbb N[n]\\coloneqq\\{p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N:\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(a_0,\\ldots,a_d)\\in\\mathbb N^{d+1}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;p(n)=\\sum_{i=0}^d a_in^i\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\nV(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\in V\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\nV(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\in V\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathrm{NP}\\leftrightarrow\\exists V\\in\\mathrm P\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbf2^{p(|x|)}\\;V(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathrm{NP}\\leftrightarrow\\exists V\\in\\mathrm P\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbf2^{p(|x|)}\\;V(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第二种刻画仍使用恰好 p(|x|) 位见证；较短见证可通过带长度标记的填充归入此形式。V∈P 作为验证关系的配对语言解释，避免把复杂度类中的语言当成机器。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-time-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-p-notation","status":"resolved","id":"533df2318af82f63","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-p-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-time-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\mathbf2$；$\\mathrm{NTIME}$、$\\mathrm P$ 见 [[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]、[[73-df-p-notation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-p-notation","status":"resolved","id":"533df2318af82f63","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\mathbf2$；$\\mathrm{NTIME}$、$\\mathrm P$ 见 [[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]、[[73-df-p-notation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}$ 使用固定 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]] 的二进制配对；$V\\in\\mathrm P$ 是语言而非机器，$V(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts}$ 由下式解释。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NTIME}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm P","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"V\\in\\mathrm P","display":false},{"tex":"V(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf2^m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"0^0=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NP}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto n^k),\\qquad\n\\mathbb N[n]\\coloneqq\\{p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N:\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(a_0,\\ldots,a_d)\\in\\mathbb N^{d+1}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;p(n)=\\sum_{i=0}^d a_in^i\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\nV(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\in V","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathrm{NP}\\leftrightarrow\\exists V\\in\\mathrm P\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbf2^{p(|x|)}\\;V(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts})","display":true}],"bytes":2739,"backlinks":[{"id":"d7e06494e0db8c00","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\mathbf2$，$\\mathrm{NP}$ 见 [[73-df-np-and-verifier-notation]]；$\\overline L$ 的全集明确为 $\\mathbf2^*$。"},{"id":"6843fe402485436b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NP}$、$\\leq_p$ 分别见 [[73-df-np-and-verifier-notation]]、[[73-df-polynomial-reduction-notation]]；集合载体均为 $\\mathbf2^*$。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-259","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-np-and-verifier-notation|np and verifier notation]]"},{"id":"e452239d1f453972","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm P,\\mathrm{NP},\\mathrm{PSPACE},\\mathrm{EXPTIME}$ 分别见 [[73-df-p-notation]]、[[73-df-np-and-verifier-notation]]、[[73-df-pspace-notation]]、[[73-df-exptime-notation]]；全部采用二进制词语言载体。"},{"id":"643ca49e5f5f7846","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L,L'\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*$；$\\mathrm{NP},\\leq_p,\\mathrm{NPC}$ 见 [[73-df-np-and-verifier-notation]]、[[73-df-polynomial-reduction-notation]]、[[73-df-np-completeness-notation]]。"},{"id":"e23c2f09d27abd49","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm P,\\mathrm{NP},\\mathrm{NPC}$ 见 [[73-df-p-notation]]、[[73-df-np-and-verifier-notation]]、[[73-df-np-completeness-notation]]。"}],"outgoing":["995085b8741b47ae","533df2318af82f63","db96cabedd089e5f"]}